{{!-- Membership. Shared by page-membership.hbs and custom-membership.hbs.

Tiers, prices and the comparison table arrive with the Standing Pages ticket, where the
prices must come from the publication's live tiers: stale prices are the worst failure mode
in the theme, and {{monthly_price}} renders an integer in the currency's smallest unit, so
every price goes through the {{price}} helper. Nothing here renders a price yet, precisely
so that no fixture copy can be mistaken for one. --}}
{{#post}}
    <article class="{{post_class}} container py-16">
        {{#if @page.show_title_and_feature_image}}
            <header class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-[720px] text-center">
                <p class="font-meta text-muted text-[12px] uppercase">{{t "Membership"}}</p>
                <h1 class="font-display text-h1 text-text mt-3 tracking-tight">{{title}}</h1>
            </header>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="mirror-content measure prose mx-auto">
            {{content}}
        </div>
    </article>
{{/post}}
